<title>GERMANY: Schaltbau unit wins 80 mln DM rail order.</title>
<headline>Schaltbau unit wins 80 mln DM rail order.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schaltbau AG's PFA unit has won an 80 million mark order from German state railways Deutsche Bahn AG to rebuild 86 rail wagons, Schaltbau said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Delivery of the renovated wagons will take place during 1997, the statement added.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
